#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:2
#: 1a36684e5d2b4578a7e874ec48788104
msgid "Measure a frame"
msgstr "测量一帧点云"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:5
#: 835f84f2189f46dca738ff4d160c5058
msgid "Inputs and coordinate frame"
msgstr "输入与坐标系"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:7
#: 4e62559e028446afa3d53f59aa3a3270
msgid ""
"Capture at least one empty-tray frame and one food frame with the same "
"camera and tray pose. All points in both inputs must use the unit set by "
"``input_unit`` (metres by default). ROI bounds and other distance parameters"
" are always in metres, even when the input points are in millimetres. The "
"empty frames should cover the part of the tray occupied by food; an absent "
"baseline cell is not replaced by a flat plane."
msgstr ""
"至少拍摄一帧空烤盘和一帧放有食材的烤盘。相机和烤盘在两次拍摄时应保持相同位置。所有输入点都使用 ``input_unit`` "
"指定的单位，默认是米。ROI 边界和其他距离参数始终使用米，即使输入点的坐标是毫米。空盘帧应覆盖食材占据的区域；没有基线数据的栅格不会被平面替代。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:14
#: 05a14de4db344ac6b03b203f80e68fc8
msgid "A minimal C++ call"
msgstr "最小 C++ 示例"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:39
#: ae9fbe20c2764985bc4c1d27564942d6
msgid ""
"For millimetre input, call ``set_input_unit(LengthUnit::kMillimeter)`` "
"before ``run()``. ``load_pcd()`` returns an empty cloud when it cannot read "
"a file. Check the return status before reading numeric fields; they are NaN "
"on failure."
msgstr ""
"毫米点云需在 ``run()`` 前调用 "
"``set_input_unit(LengthUnit::kMillimeter)``。``load_pcd()`` "
"读取失败时返回空点云。读取数值字段前先检查状态；失败时这些字段为 NaN。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:44
#: f75b1d04d72a4a1c8741c8baac77f33b
msgid "How the volume is computed"
msgstr "体积计算方法"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:46
#: e7e712b9551746288f408d59d5ec38b6
msgid ""
"The empty frames form a baseline height map on a fitted plane. Food points "
"are filtered by their height above that map, grouped by their footprint on "
"the plane, and rasterised into top-surface cells. For a cell with both a "
"baseline height and a food height, the contribution is the positive height "
"difference times the cell area:"
msgstr "空盘帧在拟合平面上形成基线高度图。食材点按高出基线的高度筛选，再按其平面足迹分组，并栅格化为顶面。对于同时有基线和食材高度的栅格，贡献量是正的高度差乘以栅格面积："

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:55
#: 1dc2cf2c75964225a32932ca16a9ba70
msgid "Grid of observed empty-tray points"
msgstr "空烤盘实测点组成的栅格"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:55
#: 874e864755dc479a95838f4114265057
msgid "Empty-tray observations used to form the baseline grid."
msgstr "空盘观测点用于建立基线栅格。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:57
#: 180e90ab627a4403afb8cddcff68ff18
msgid ""
"V = \\sum_{c \\in C} "
"\\bigl(h_{\\mathrm{food}}(c)-h_{\\mathrm{tray}}(c)\\bigr)\\,s^2"
msgstr ""
"V = \\sum_{c \\in C} "
"\\bigl(h_{\\mathrm{food}}(c)-h_{\\mathrm{tray}}(c)\\bigr)\\,s^2"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:61
#: a0e54613e6514f4195e018d5763950b1
msgid ""
"Here ``s`` is ``integration_resolution_m`` and ``C`` contains accepted "
"measured and filled cells. The implementation converts cubic metres to cubic"
" centimetres for ``volume_cm3``. It may fill an enclosed hole only when the "
"rim belongs to one food component and the safety checks pass. "
"``raw_volume_cm3`` and ``interpolated_volume_cm3`` separate observed from "
"inferred volume; an unfilled hole contributes neither."
msgstr ""
"其中 ``s`` 为 ``integration_resolution_m``，``C`` 包含被接受的实测和补洞栅格。``volume_cm3`` "
"会把计算得到的立方米换算为立方厘米。只有孔洞边界属于单个食材块且通过保护条件，才会进行补全。``raw_volume_cm3`` 和 "
"``interpolated_volume_cm3`` 分别表示实测与推算体积；未填充的孔洞不计入任何一项。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:71
#: 086d0586bbc54d4e930db5b2da4a61b8
msgid "Food points above the tray grid"
msgstr "烤盘栅格上方的食材点"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:71
#: 4a3ea36ec9e245a2abbf0f08ad3a139f
msgid "Food surface points compared with the tray grid before integration."
msgstr "积分前，将食材顶面点与烤盘栅格比较。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:74
#: 9a3cf8f90fd74fcf9514a511b6ea6243
msgid "Reading the result"
msgstr "如何看结果"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:76
#: 8840a69a01d74f14a581e152b7d0450d
msgid ""
"``component_count`` and ``component_estimates`` describe the selected food "
"components. ``selected_cluster_labels`` is aligned with "
"``component_estimates``. ``measured_cells`` and ``interpolated_cells`` count"
" observed and filled top-surface cells; ``unfilled_hole_cells`` counts gaps "
"left unresolved. ``missing_baseline_cells`` counts food cells without a "
"usable empty-tray reference. ``coverage_ratio`` is the occupied fraction of "
"the component bounding grid, not a confidence score. AABB, OBB, and convex-"
"hull volumes are geometric references in cubic metres; they do not use the "
"tray height integral."
msgstr ""
"``component_count`` 和 ``component_estimates`` "
"描述被选中的食材块；``selected_cluster_labels`` 与 ``component_estimates`` "
"一一对应。``measured_cells`` 和 ``interpolated_cells`` "
"分别统计实测与补全的顶面栅格，``unfilled_hole_cells`` 是仍未填补的孔洞栅格。``missing_baseline_cells``"
" 表示缺少空盘参考的食材栅格。``coverage_ratio`` 是连通块包围栅格中被占用的比例，不是置信度。AABB、OBB "
"和凸包体积是立方米单位的几何参考值，不采用烤盘高度积分。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:85
#: 2d7140d1439a4a9e9b264fbd6a9e8a37
msgid "Configuration without duplicate switches"
msgstr "减少重复开关的配置"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:87
#: 13aafeaab2d3478190e0d0c65c7d2f61
msgid ""
"Defaults are intended as a starting point. Change only the values your "
"capture requires:"
msgstr "默认参数可作为起点，只改当前采集确实需要调整的值："

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:96
#: 778bb20226f54360aa701b7b4680f564
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An ROI object enables cropping; ``clear_roi()`` disables it. An empty "
"``selected_labels`` selects all eligible components; "
"``set_selected_labels({0})`` selects label 0. A nonempty "
"``middle_cloud_dir`` enables intermediate PCD output and an empty path "
"disables it. The secondary background plane, when enabled in "
"``MeasurementConfig``, uses the same ``plane_distance_threshold_m`` as the "
"primary plane."
msgstr ""
"提供 ROI 对象即启用裁剪，``clear_roi()`` 关闭裁剪。``selected_labels`` "
"为空时选择所有合格连通块；``set_selected_labels({0})`` 只选标签 0。``middle_cloud_dir`` "
"非空时保存中间 PCD，空路径则关闭。若在 ``MeasurementConfig`` 中启用次级背景平面移除，它与主平面共用 "
"``plane_distance_threshold_m``。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:102
#: e533f04e9bdc4d128a60ebd3b6e29ab8
msgid "A JSON file may contain just the fields to override, for example:"
msgstr "JSON 文件可以只写需要覆盖的字段，例如："

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:112
#: e255fa4cb9524e799c6dc78fbe5eef3b
msgid ""
"Call ``load_config_from_json(path)`` before ``run()`` and check its Boolean "
"return value. Removed or unknown keys are rejected. Save a full snapshot "
"with ``save_config_to_json(path)``."
msgstr ""
"在 ``run()`` 前调用 ``load_config_from_json(path)``，并检查布尔返回值。已删除或未知的键会被拒绝。调用 "
"``save_config_to_json(path)`` 可保存完整配置快照。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:116
#: 419359c79152481f8b934fa4b76a3eba
msgid "Inspecting a measurement"
msgstr "检查一次测量"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:118
#: 11f69da1c4304e9eaea31a53cbf47acf
msgid ""
"With ``middle_cloud_dir`` set, a successful run writes stage PCD files. "
"Compare ``5_top_surface.pcd`` (measured top cells) with "
"``6_hole_filled_surface.pcd`` (measured plus accepted filled cells). "
"``4_food_component_label<NN>.pcd`` isolates each selected component. These "
"files use world coordinates. If ``missing_baseline_cells`` is high, capture "
"more of the empty tray. If ``interpolated_cells`` is high, inspect the "
"missing region before trusting the filled volume."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``middle_cloud_dir`` 后，成功测量会写出各阶段 PCD。比较 ``5_top_surface.pcd``（实测顶面栅格）和 "
"``6_hole_filled_surface.pcd``（实测加已接受的补洞栅格）；``4_food_component_label<NN>.pcd``"
" 可单独查看选中的食材块。文件使用世界坐标。若 ``missing_baseline_cells`` 很多，应补拍空盘覆盖区域；若 "
"``interpolated_cells`` 很多，应先检查缺失区域，再决定是否采用补洞体积。"

#: ../../home/min/project/food3d_im/docs/sphinx/source/export.rst:125
#: 4dbd4a1702744da4859e79f680ea0aa7
msgid ""
"For several food frames against the same empty tray, set the first food "
"frame and call ``prepare_baseline()`` once. After a successful preparation, "
"``set_food()`` followed by ``run()`` reuses the baseline. Keep the camera, "
"tray, input unit, and baseline-related parameters fixed; changing baseline "
"inputs or their parameters invalidates the cache. The first food frame is "
"also used to orient the plane normal, so later frames must be on the same "
"side of the tray."
msgstr ""
"若多帧食材使用同一空烤盘基线，可先设置第一帧食材并调用一次 ``prepare_baseline()``。准备成功后，重复调用 "
"``set_food()`` 和 ``run()`` "
"会复用基线。保持相机、烤盘、输入单位和基线相关参数不变；修改基线输入或相关参数会使缓存失效。第一帧食材还用于确定平面法向，因此后续食材必须位于烤盘同侧。"

